oved the crawfish! omg! Not too spicy just right! I will return to Mid City. They need to open a restaurant on the Westbank. Call it Algiers Seafood."},{"business_id":"YXa3WGz3o66MQXW9lMgxsw","review_id":"8qZw6lSqeUvBxWYW3SPvlA","date":"2021-04-19T14:53:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.934027373790741,"text_excerpt":"I will be adding Mid City Seafood where to get crawfish list. The crawfish were so juicy and seasoned just right. I also ordered corn and a turkey neck. Along with the delicious garlic butter sauce. Their prices are reasonable for the quality and amount of food, the turkey neck was huge. The inside of the store was also very neat and clean. All the employees wore masks and were nice. I will be back to visit."},{"business_id":"YXa3WGz3o66MQXW9lMgxsw","review_id":"qj65OQCZqVsLJpAzxi6NaQ","date":"2014-03-13T16:31:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9294188618659973,"text_excerpt":"I instantly judged this place by the misleading name. It's not in Mid City but the food is here is really good. The crawfish are seasoned to perfection and the shrimp po boys surprised me as well."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YXa3WGz3o66MQXW9lMgxsw","photo_id":"U3xODeHthTPmaKDiJItjvw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/U3xODeHthTPmaKDiJItjvw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
